WEBVTT

00:00:03.008 --> 00:00:12.010
Welcome to the luxury data center tour! Pool, gym, clubhouse! Apartment-grade class!

00:00:15.018 --> 00:00:24.020
Just inference. Data centers cool their chips with water. That pool is a spec, not a luxury.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:32.020
So the apartment instincts were right all along? The chips must love the spa.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:38.036
Which is why phase two, phase three! The more we build, the more we sell!

00:00:38.036 --> 00:00:48.041
We skip the bidding war. Our AI runs in the customer's own racks. No building rent, no meters.

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:56.379
Exactly. Our only amenity is the break-room fridge. It cools so well the spa is optional.

